# Build artefacts and installed trees — the image builds its own.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/build
**/dist
**/.svelte-kit

# Live data must never end up baked into an image.
data
**/data
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm

# Secrets. The example file is documentation and carries no values, but a filled-in
# judging.env must never reach the build context.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!*.env.example

.git
.gitlab-ci.yml
.github
.vscode
.cursor
docs
*.md
!README.md
